<?php /** 赛事业务视图；负责人：王乐之（2411302）；AI辅助开发。 */ use yii\helpers\Html;$this->title='积分与射手榜';?><h1>积分榜与射手榜</h1><form method="get" class="wc-filters"><select name="tournament_id"><?php foreach($tournaments as $t):?><option value="<?= $t->id ?>" <?= $selected==$t->id?'selected':'' ?>><?= Html::encode($t->name) ?></option><?php endforeach ?></select><button>刷新</button></form><p>小组积分只按常规90分钟：胜3分、平1分、负0分；依次比较积分、净胜球、进球数。点球大战不计入。</p><h2>小组积分</h2><table><tr><th>组</th><th>球队</th><th>赛</th><th>胜</th><th>平</th><th>负</th><th>进</th><th>失</th><th>积分</th></tr><?php foreach($standings as $r):?><tr><td><?= Html::encode($groups[$r['group_id']]->name??'') ?></td><td><?= Html::encode($teams[$r['team_id']]->name??'') ?></td><td><?= $r['played'] ?></td><td><?= $r['win'] ?></td><td><?= $r['draw'] ?></td><td><?= $r['loss'] ?></td><td><?= $r['gf'] ?></td><td><?= $r['ga'] ?></td><td><b><?= $r['points'] ?></b></td></tr><?php endforeach ?></table><h2>射手榜</h2><p>正式进球含比赛内点球和加时，不含乌龙球及点球大战。</p><table><tr><th>球员</th><th>球队</th><th>进球</th><th>其中点球</th></tr><?php foreach($scorers as $r):?><tr><td><?= Html::a(Html::encode($r['name']),['player/view','id'=>$r['player_id']]) ?></td><td><?= Html::encode($r['team_name']) ?></td><td><?= $r['goals'] ?></td><td><?= $r['penalties'] ?></td></tr><?php endforeach ?></table>